;
; How Signpost files a cached answer in MYRA (signpost_rules.h SP5): its
; place in the cache, the class of its address (SP4), the IPv4 address as
; one number (a * 16777216 + b * 65536 + c * 256 + d), the second it was
; stored (unix time) and its time to live in seconds.
^ZXSIGNPOST(seq:i9) = class:i1! ^ addr:i10! ^ stored:i11! ^ ttl:i10!
